@Catalog.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095

### Salud (incluye conexión a Postgres)
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Aeropuertos
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/airports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "LIM", "name": "Jorge Chávez", "city": "Lima", "country": "Perú", "timeZoneId": "America/Lima" }

###
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/airports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "SCL", "name": "Arturo Merino Benítez", "city": "Santiago", "country": "Chile", "timeZoneId": "America/Santiago" }

###
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/airports

###
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/airports/LIM

### Aerolínea
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/airlines
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "LA", "name": "LATAM" }

### Tipo de aeronave (copiar el aircraftTypeId de la respuesta)
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/aircraft-types
Content-Type: application/json

{ "model": "Airbus A320", "seatMap": { "Economy": 150, "Business": 12 } }

### Vuelo: sale 22:30 hora de Lima, que en UTC ya es el día siguiente
@aircraftTypeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/flights
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "airlineCode": "LA",
  "flightNumber": 2400,
  "origin": "LIM",
  "destination": "SCL",
  "aircraftTypeId": "{{aircraftTypeId}}",
  "departureAt": "2026-10-10T22:30:00-05:00",
  "arrivalAt": "2026-10-11T04:00:00-03:00"
}

### Tarifa (copiar el flightId de la respuesta anterior)
@flightId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/flights/{{flightId}}/fare-classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cabin": "Economy", "price": 199.90, "currency": "USD", "totalSeats": 100 }

###
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/flights/{{flightId}}

### Búsqueda por día LOCAL del origen: encuentra el vuelo de las 22:30 del 10/10
GET {{Catalog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/flights?origin=LIM&destination=SCL&departureDate=2026-10-10&passengerCount=2
